# Schwab access token for this WebSocket client
#
# REQUIRED API access (Trader API):
#   - Accounts and Trading → Account Access
#   - Accounts and Trading → User Preferences
#
# Needed so GET /trader/v1/userPreference succeeds and returns streamerInfo
# (WebSocket URL + client IDs). Without that, streaming cannot start.
#
# DO NOT use a Market Data-only token (Trader API → Market Data).
# Market Data tokens can call quotes/chains, but userPreference returns 401.
#
# Format: one line with the raw access token only (no "Bearer " prefix).
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
YOUR_SCHWAB_TRADER_API_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
